  "title": "Three Hours",
  "summary": "Glen goes silent for a day, then accidentally forwards a hospital parking receipt: Bridgewater, 6:31 to 8:47 pm on 12 January. He explains. He has early, treatable prostate cancer, and the results came that night. He and June had planned to tell the family together. Owen softens. Tess finds June's email password and, in her inbox, a developer's message sent the day after she died.",
