      "messages": [
        {
          "kind": "timestamp",
          "id": "t01",
          "label": "Wed, Feb 10 at 12:15 PM"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "In November I had a scan. Prostate. June drove me"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "The results came on the 12th. The doctor could only see me that evening so I left the bonspiel at 6... told the boys my back was sore"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "It's early. Very treatable they said. Radiation in the spring"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "June and I agreed we'd tell you and Owen together. When you came down on the Saturday"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "I sat in the car after and phoned her at 8.50 to say it was good news. She didnt answer. I thought she was in the bath"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "She was on the stairs Tess. While I sat in a parking lot feeling lucky"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "Glen, I'm so sorry. For all of it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "I'm coming down this weekend. You're not doing radiation on your own."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "You have your own life dear"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "You're in it. That's not up for debate."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m11",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "I've been eating her preserves for supper. The cellar shelf is still full. I can't go down there yet..."
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "beat": "Glen's secret."
      }
